# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build artefacts — never commit these.
#
# Everything below is REGENERATED from the sources in branding/ and steps/.
# Keeping it out of git is what keeps this repository small and what stops it
# growing by tens of megabytes at every release.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# live-build work directory (several GB during a build)
/.work/

# version-stamped copies of steps/*.sh, produced by build.sh
/.gen/

# branding packages, produced by make-debs.sh
/local/extra_debs/
/local/extra_debs.tmp/
/local/make-debs.log

# packages built by each tool's make-deb.sh
/tools/*/build-deb/

# images and checksums
*.iso

SHA256SUMS

# generated website (built by site/build.py, uploaded by release.sh)
/site/public/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
/RELEASE-NOTES-*.md
